  "historyNote": "#6336, eff 9-24-96; ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12; renumbered by #13002 (formerly Rev 1607.01); ss by #13126-B, eff 10-24-20; ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
